      m_Calls: []
  m_text: The capture-pass latch has two modes. In pass mode input data (D) gets
    directly transferred to the output (Q). The latch is in pass mode when (C=0,P=0)
    or (C=1,P=1). In capture mode the last input (D) gets sampled. This is the case
    when (C=1,P=0) or (C=0,P=1).
